{"outcomes":[{"sourceUrl":"https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/knowledge-base?language=en_US","depth":0,"index":"indexed","publication":{"status":"published","path":"30 Tools-Models/Doc Sets/audienceview/Help Articles & Documentation f4b13c9c4e66.md","markdown":"---\ntype: source\ntitle: Help Articles & Documentation\nsource_url: https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/knowledge-base?language=en_US\nrequested_url: https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/knowledge-base?language=en_US\nsource_id: f4b13c9c4e66b76966ae9b438e95aab3be8818ce971e90f15646a440cf864fa3\ncollection: audienceview\nversion: \"\"\ncaptured_at: 2026-09-15T10:20:54.696Z\nsource_content_type: text/html\ncontent_sha256: 2ba50f43c0d70a74a07891de3550152c1af53cac5194264ab7c446ea889feac5\npublisher: secondbrain-docs\npublisher_version: 3.1.0\n---\nLoading\n\nSkip to Main Content\n\n# Knowledge Base\n\n  \n\nAccess help articles including product guides, best practices for success, and step-by-step guides.\n\n# **Navigation**\n\n  \n\nThe product guides are broken up into topics that cover each area of the Desktop as well as the various sales channels.\n\n  \n\nEach topic has a main article that branches into detailed how-tos and step by steps for configuration. There are also articles for best practices, recipes for success and other tips broken down by category.\n\n**Search**\n\n  \n\nThe best way to find what you're looking for is by using the search bar at the top of any page in the portal.\n\n  \n\nThe search functionality works like any search engine with the most relevant articles rising to the top of the results. In results, you can find any related product documentation, best practices, and discussions.\n\n-   Product Guides\n-   Best Practices & Tips\n-   Integrations & Hardware\n\n# Product Guides\n\n  \n\nUse the search at the top of this or any page in the portal to find what you need.\n\n## **Getting Started**\n\nGet started with using AudienceView Unlimited with an [overview of the system](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/introduction) and tips on how [configure your system](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/audienceview-unlimited-configu).\n\n  \n\n[View All Articles & Discussions](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/topic/0TO4T000000XzYHWA0/getting-started)\n\n## **Customer Services** \n\n[Customer Services](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/Customer-Services) is the key to your customer relationship management and sales, helping to provide personalized service and care.\n\n  \n\n[View All Articles & Discussions](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/topic/0TO4T000000kBgTWAU/customer-services)\n\n## Business Intelligence & Reports\n\n[Business Intelligence and Reports](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/intelligence-and-repo) are used to run reports, create and run queries, and create extracts get the data from your database you're looking for.\n\n  \n\n[View All Articles & Discussions](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/topic/0TO4T000000LDN2WAO/business-intelligence-reports)\n\n## **Configurations**\n\n###### [**Access Control**](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/access-control)\n\nScan and validate tickets when ticket holders attempt to enter an event.\n\n  \n\n[View All Articles](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/topic/0TOMm000000q7ztOAA/access-control)\n\n[**Application Security**](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/security)\n\nAdd and maintain users, roles and groups and their permissions.\n\n  \n\n[View All Articles](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/topic/0TO4T000000LDMzWAO/application-security?language=en_US&tabset-ed4ea=2)\n\n[**Event Configuration**](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/Event-Configuration) \n\nBuild and maintain venues, events and price charts.\n\n  \n\n[View All Articles](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/topic/0TOMm000000qBLyOAM/event-configuration)\n\n[**Funds Management**](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/funds-management)\n\nCreate, track and maintain fundraising programs and funds. \n\n  \n\n[View All Articles](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/topic/0TOMm000000qBLzOAM/funds-management)\n\n[**General Configuration**](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/General-Configuration)\n\nGeneral items that can used during day-to-day business across the system.\n\n[View All Articles](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/topic/0TOMm000000q9DhOAI/general-configuration)\n\n[**Legends**](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/Legends) \n\nConfigure visual representations for price zones, hold types and price types.\n\n  \n\n[View All Articles](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/topic/0TOMm000000qA05OAE/legends)\n\n[**My Notes and Shortcuts**](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/My-Notes-and-Shortcuts) \n\nTrack notes/tasks and reports that have been assigned to individual users.\n\n[View All Articles](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/topic/0TOMm000000r4DZOAY/my-notes-shortcuts)\n\n[**Organization Management**](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/Organization-Management) \n\nManage your event owners, contracts and settlements.\n\n[View All Articles](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/topic/0TOMm000000qAHpOAM/organization-management)\n\n[**Product Configuration**](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/Product-Configuration) \n\nConfigure sellable items, items of monetary worth, benefits, and promotions.\n\n[View All Articles](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/topic/0TOMm000000qAOHOA2/product-configuration)\n\n[**Registry**](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/Registry)\n\nCustomize most aspects of your system, including labels, alerts, gateways, ports and more.  \n\n[View All Articles](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/topic/0TOMm000000qAT7OAM/registry)\n\n## Content Management & Online\n\n[Content Management](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/contentmanagement) is where you configure your [online](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/configuration) store where customers purchase, donate, renew and pay.\n\n  \n\n[View All Articles & Discussions](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/topic/0TOMm000000qA89OAE/content-management-online)\n\n## Correspondence & Emails\n\n[Correspondence](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/Email-Marketing) is used send messages to your customers via email or to a customer's online account.\n\n  \n\n[View All Articles & Discussions](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/topic/0TO4T000000LDN4WAO/correspondence-emails)\n\n## Utilities & Data Management\n\n[Utilities](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/Utilities) enables you to perform a number of functions in a batch to update events, manage renewals, and print in large quantities.\n\n  \n\n[View All Articles & Discussions](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/topic/0TOMm000000qAo5OAE/utilities-data-management)\n\n# Best Practices & Tips\n\n## Worksheets\n\n  \n\nFillable worksheets to help you plan your configurations.\n\n  \n\n[**Go to the worksheets**](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/AudienceView-Unlimited-Worksheets) →\n\n## **Handbooks**\n\n  \n\nA foundational guide for you to use to create a manual for your day-to-day operations.\n\n  \n\n[**Go to the handbook guide**](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/article/Customer-Services-Manual) →\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n  \n\nFind resources for troubleshooting error messages and issues.\n\n  \n\n[**Access troubleshooting articles**](https://audienceview2.my.site.com/AudienceView/s/topic/0TO4T000000rcIpWAI/troubleshooting) →\n\n-   ### Recipe for Success\n    \n    -   [Recipe for Success: Customer Database Cleanup](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Recipe-for-Success-Customer-Database-Cleanup)\n    -   [Recipe for Success: Renewing Bundles & Creating Offers](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Recipe-for-Success-Renewing-Bundles-Creating-Offers)\n    -   [Recipe for Success: Event Reporting](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Recipe-for-Success-Event-Reporting)\n    -   [Recipe for Success: Fulfilling Group Sales Using Offers](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Recipe-for-Success-Fulfilling-Group-Sales-Using-Offers)\n    -   [Recipe for Success: Giving the Gift of Membership](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Recipe-for-Success-Giving-the-Gift-of-Membership)\n    \n\nNo topics yet.\n\nLoading\n\n-   ### Success Blueprints\n    \n    -   [Success Blueprint: Build Your Executive Director the Perfect Dashboard for the Upcoming Season](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Success-Blueprint-Build-Your-Executive-Director-the-Perfect-Dashboard-for-the-Upcoming-Season)\n    -   [Success Blueprint: Configure Quick Sale for Maximum Speed in the Box Office](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Success-Blueprint-Configure-Quick-Sale-for-Maximum-Speed-in-the-Box-Office)\n    -   [Success Blueprint: Automatically Send Renewal Reminder Emails](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Success-Blueprint-Automatically-Send-Renewal-Reminder-Emails)\n    -   [Success Blueprint: Find the Status of Any Ticket in 60 Seconds](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Success-Blueprint-Find-the-Status-of-Any-Ticket-in-60-Seconds)\n    -   [Success Blueprint: Outbound Sales - Using Notes to Track Opportunities](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Success-Blueprint-Outbound-Sales-Using-Notes-to-Track-Opportunities)\n    \n\nNo topics yet.\n\nLoading\n\n-   ### Your Best BI\n    \n    -   [Your Best BI: Promotion Codes and One Time Access Codes](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Your-Best-BI-For-Promotion-Codes-and-One-Time-Access-Codes)\n    -   [Your Best BI: Getting Deep Links to Events](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Your-Best-BI-New-BI-Event-Deep-links)\n    -   [Your Best BI: Scheduled Reports, BIs, and Data Management Jobs](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Your-Best-BI-for-Scheduled-Reports-BIs-and-Data-Management-Jobs)\n    -   [Your Best BI: Event Questions and Answers](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Your-Best-BI-for-Questions-and-Answers)\n    -   [Your Best BI: Proofing Multiple Events](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Your-Best-BI-Proofing-Multiple-Events)\n    \n\nNo topics yet.\n\nLoading\n\n-   ### Tips & Tricks\n    \n    -   [On-Sale Tips & Tricks](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/On-Sale-Best-Practices)\n    -   [Refunding & Cancelling Tickets Tips & Tricks](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Tips-Tricks-Refunds-Canceled-Tickets)\n    -   [Online Tips & Tricks](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Online-Tips-Tricks)\n    -   [Business Intelligence & Reports Tips & Tricks](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Business-Intelligence-Reports-Tips-Tricks)\n    -   [Bundle Checklist](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Bundle-Checklist)\n    \n\nNo topics yet.\n\nLoading\n\n# Integrations & Hardware\n\n-   ### Partnerships & Integrations\n    \n    -   [Preparing for SparkPost](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Sparkpost)\n    -   [Bluefin: Adding P2PE/EMV Terminals](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Bluefin-Adding-P2PE-EMV-Terminals)\n    -   [Getting Started with Google Tag Manager](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Getting-Started-with-Google-Tag-Manager)\n    -   [AudienceView Spotlight Product Updates](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Spotlight-Product-Updates)\n    -   [Partnerships & Integration](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Partnerships-Integration)\n    \n\nNo topics yet.\n\nLoading\n\n-   ### Hardware\n    \n    -   [Printer Gateway Application](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Printer-Gateway-Application)\n    -   [AudienceView Ticket Scanners](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/AudienceView-Ticket-Scanners-Unlimited)\n    -   [Using AudienceView Ticket Scanners](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Ticket-Scanners)\n    -   [BOCA Printers](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/BOCA-Printer)\n    -   [Troubleshooting Scanners](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Scanner-Troubleshooting-Unlimited)\n    \n\nNo topics yet.\n\nLoading\n\n-   ### Spotlight\n    \n    -   [AudienceView Spotlight Product Updates](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Spotlight-Product-Updates)\n    -   [Getting Started with the Spotlight CMS Portal](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Spotlight-CMS-Portal)\n    -   [Deep Links](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Spotlight-Deep-Links)\n    -   [Content](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Spotlight-Content)\n    -   [Dynamic Content Guide](https://help.audienceview.com/unlimited/s/article/Spotlight-Dynamic-Content-Guide)\n    \n\nNo topics yet.\n\nLoading\n\nLoading\n\nHelp Articles & Documentation","digest":"4ce09910aa39faf193f5f7f1f82d9699e6ecc38094a0cb9bd3061952a000f0d6","moc":"linked"}}],"counts":{"total":1,"published":1,"unchanged":0,"replaced":0,"conflict":0,"notModified":0,"notFound":0,"fetchFailed":0,"error":0},"cancelled":false,"exitCode":0}
